WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:06.700
TOTAL ECLIPSE

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.370
<i>Long, long, long ago,</i>

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.050
<i>the gods created the world.</i>

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:14.500
<i>Time passed, and a prodigious player appeared</i>

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.480
<i>whose skills rivaled the gods'.</i>

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:22.600
<i>That player wielded a thunderbolt ball,</i>

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.020
<i>and saved both Earthdash and the Moon in their hour of need.</i>

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:29.340
<i>He was revered as a legend.</i>

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.370
Aurora, the sky...

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.500
This is the legend, Flora.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:53.030
It is...?

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.130
The only one who can save Earthdash and the Moon...

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:09.270
Basquash!

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:18.150
Is something the matter, Princess?

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:20.740
That was the legend...

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:22.550
The savior.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:43.580
Eclipse is disbanding!

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:49.300
We will return to being just normal girls!

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:56.050
We're holding our last concert in the Skybloom Kingdom.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.220
Don't cry, Violette.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.710
Be sure to come!

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:04.230
To Eclipse's final concert.

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:06.950
Rouge wants to see you too.

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:09.530
We're waiting for the legend.

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:13.900
They're calling for you, Legend.

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:17.880
Hey, Legend.

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:23.280
Hey, what's the deal?

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.620
Didn't Eclipse go back to the Moon?

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:34.180
There's been a rumor amongst the fans that Rouge's illness...

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:37.930
...was too advanced for her to return to the Moon.

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:41.390
B-But that's just a rumor.

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:48.530
Could it be that this has something to do with the legend, too?

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.670
Come to think of it, where's Dan?

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:52.860
I'll go look for him.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.230
What are you thinking about?

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.720
I'm not thinking at all.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:12.350
This is Dan you're talking about...

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:14.840
But...

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:15.550
But?

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:18.030
It's like there's this big confused muddle.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:20.300
In my chest.

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:24.960
It won't go away. I dunno why, but I can't relax.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:27.310
Giants...

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:29.730
...and Underground...

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:32.400
...and Turbine City...

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:36.320
...and disbanding...

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:40.410
What the hell is wrong with me?

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.690
Shit!

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:44.840
Ow! Ow ow ow! Hey stupid-head, calm down!

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:44.330
Shit, shit, shit!

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:46.790
Be worried and calm!

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:51.600
Mr. Dan feels something too.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.510
So did that build your character any?

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:56.940
Worrying is what makes us all grown-ups!

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:57.750
Shut up!

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.600
This is very tight security.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.110
I appreciate the Lunatic Corporation's help.

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:14.730
No one can hijack your cannon now.

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:17.120
There's no time.

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:19.640
The first manifestation will appear any day now.

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:20.350
Yes.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:23.030
Did the stones speak to you?

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:27.090
Is the plan on schedule?

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:31.340
We'll use Eclipse's songs to activate the ultinium ore.

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:32.250
Once we do...

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:36.210
I'll be able to hear the voice of the stones again.

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:39.480
Yes. Your Majesty is the last remaining Speaker.

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:43.050
To usher in a thousand years of prosperity for this country,

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.850
you are absolutely essential.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:47.020
Essential?

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:50.590
Your people will long remember your greatness.

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:55.500
They will tell how you saved not only Skybloom, but Earthdash and the Moon...

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.660
...when two worlds would have collided.

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:06.430
I expect great things.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:10.690
Please leave it to me. Your Majesty will soon be shown the legend.

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:27.450
There are only two days left.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:28.580
Can we meet the deadline?

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.910
I'll make sure we do, Mr. Yan.

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:35.800
After all, this is Eclipse's farewell concert.

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:38.350
We'll show them all a legend.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:43.240
But will they be okay without a proper rehearsal?

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:45.700
Oh!

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:48.450
That <i>is</i> their rehearsal.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.680
Violette.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:08.500
For the legend...

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:14.520
In order to save Earthdash and the Moon, we have to hang tough.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.400
I know.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:23.170
I know... that's why Rouge wanted the upgrade.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:31.580
There's no turning back now.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.860
Whatever it takes to become the true legend...

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:37.040
Do it.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:50.480
Mr. Dan.

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:02.100
Sorry!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:05.280
The Dangan and your Zephyr can't be moved just yet.

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:07.230
Oh, okay.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:08.700
Use that if you want.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.740
We'll catch up after I'm done with the maintenance.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.280
Leave now and you can still catch him.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:16.880
Hang in there.

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:19.490
Okay!

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.330
He's in your hands, Alan.

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:42.190
What is Yan trying to do with Eclipse?

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:46.700
I don't know what he's after, but we'll carry on with the plan.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:49.300
There's not much time left to us.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:52.830
I'll keep searching Earthdash for legend candidates until the very last minute.

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.650
What about my brother?

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:58.750
The Executive Council saw the last match and granted permission to induct Dan.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.170
But how will he get to the Moon?

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:04.120
They can't commandeer the Moon Cannon again.

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:07.500
That's true.

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:10.470
But we aren't out of tricks yet.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:30.730
Why do you keep following me?

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:32.860
Because I'm worried...

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:37.020
Yeah, I'm worried for Rouge too.

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:38.830
Y-Yeah.

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:45.020
No spazzing out, Alan.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:47.300
Sorry, Mr. Dan.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:49.760
Don't call me Mr. Dan.

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:54.720
Um... What are you going to do when you see Rouge?

00:08:57.990 --> 00:08:58.980
Mr. Dan?

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:00.730
I dunno.

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:02.370
You don't know?

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:05.650
I'll use this time to think it over.

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:07.870
It's just...

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:13.100
When I see her, this muddle in my chest might go away.

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:14.280
I get that feeling.

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:21.100
Miss Rouge is cute, isn't she?

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:22.690
Yeah.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:24.900
And she's a girl.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:27.170
Yeah. So?

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:30.830
I just think... I just feel...

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:32.890
All I know is I'm going to see Rouge.

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:36.300
There's no way in hell to figure out what women are thinking,

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.430
so that's just a waste of time.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:41.830
Hang in there.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:45.800
Easy to say, but...

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.620
The stadium is complete.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:06.890
We somehow finished in time for tomorrow's concert,

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:07.960
didn't we, Professor Thousand?

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:18.810
All we need now to activate the ore and extract the <i>legendo balletto</i> is Dan JD.

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:22.760
There's no doubt that Dan will come.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.980
He will herald the birth of the legend.

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:39.410
Father, my voice doesn't reach them.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.870
No one's voice does.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:46.020
Yet your voice has journeyed and seen the world,

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:50.210
has hurt, grieved, and grown strong...

00:10:51.850 --> 00:10:55.000
You're near, aren't you, Flora?

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:03.680
Dammit.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:08.480
Why do I have to wear this again?

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.440
A stunningly ugly development!

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:15.210
There's a price on our heads for hijacking the Moon Cannon.

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:17.700
We can't get across the border unless we go in disguise.

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:21.830
Sheesh, prices on our heads for a little thing like that...

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:25.140
These Skybloom types sure are chicken-hearted, aren't they?

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.870
Y-Yes, certainly.

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:29.430
Stupid-<i>ugly</i>-head!

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.050
Shut up! You little...

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:34.410
Stop it! Being ugly is the best thing about you!

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:38.720
Wh-What do you think?

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:40.600
About what?

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:43.790
About... About...

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:44.180
Huh?

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:48.940
Hey, get out your ID.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:50.370
Yeah, yeah.

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:54.050
You understand, Mr. Dan?

00:11:54.050 --> 00:11:56.800
Keep your voice soft or you'll give us away.

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:58.240
I got it.

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:00.320
Dan, look at that!

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.660
What the? It doesn't look like me at all.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:06.480
No, it captures you perfectly!

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:08.080
Your ugly side.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.010
Who're you calling ugly? It doesn't look like me!

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:11.100
Oh, it does, ugly!

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:12.260
No it doesn't!

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:14.600
Mr. Dan, be quiet!

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.010
What're you going to do about it, ugly?

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:17.800
I said it doesn't look like me!

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:20.890
Look good and hard!

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:26.050
That poster and the real Dunk Mask look <i>nothing</i> alike!

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:29.840
Idiot!

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:32.240
It's Dunk Mask!

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:33.330
Get him!

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:34.630
There's a reward!

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:42.450
Dumbass! You gave us away!

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:44.110
Don't try pinning this on me, stupid-head.

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:46.480
What do we do?

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:48.970
Their security's getting heavier and heavier.

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:50.670
Isn't there some other point we could cross?

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:53.630
The whole city perimeter is locked down.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:55.840
There will be guards' eyes gleaming at every corner.

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:00.260
The underground stream!

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:02.090
Underground stream?

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.640
It flows from the mountains to beneath the city.

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:08.230
But the current is rather strong, so it's extremely dangerous.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:12.690
I said it was dangerous!

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:14.440
You have balls, right?!

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.050
Balls?

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:17.940
Alan! Ahead!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:26.090
Hey, Spanky!

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:33.080
Are you okay?

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:42.760
Man, you're bony. Are you eating enough?

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.790
Y-Yeah.

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:04.410
He's here.

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:07.340
Dan's here. He came to see you.

00:14:15.550 --> 00:14:17.740
Yan, how is Rouge's condition?

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:19.160
There's no cause for concern.

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:20.800
She'll go directly to the stadium.

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:23.380
Tonight, Eclipse will become legend.

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:29.880
You'll activate the ultinium ore and use the force of its reaction to push the Moon back into place.

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:34.880
By joining your strength together, you three will save Earthdash and the Moon.

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.690
Understand, basquashers?

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:38.730
Basquashers...

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:39.940
Yes!

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.200
Hey, you'll catch a cold.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:46.660
Hey!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.470
What are you—?!

00:14:57.470 --> 00:14:59.420
If you don't take it off, you'll catch a cold.

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.240
Come on, strip! Strip!

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:02.540
You're soaking wet.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:04.720
Come on.

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:07.090
No! I'm not ready yet!

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:11.520
Mr. Dan?

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:14.340
Totally... can't figure you out...

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:19.730
An exit?

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.660
This way!

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:28.700
You know your way around, huh?

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:30.030
Lead the way!

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:32.680
H-Hey!

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:50.320
What links my heart...

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:47.960
We'll have to take the long way around, but three blocks further on...

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:58.590
...to your heart is...

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:52.680
Rouge?

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:53.930
That's Rouge!

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:01.010
Mr. Dan!

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:08.140
What's that?

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:09.220
Where's it coming from?

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:23.320
It's a force that spills over, crimson...

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.420
Can you hear me, Rouge?

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:30.170
We'll be running on!

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.030
The players are assembled.

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:36.020
Soon the lights will dim.

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:38.670
She can't hear me?

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:40.100
Rouge!

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:43.980
Mr. Dan!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.650
It's Dunk Mask! After him!

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:49.200
He's a wanted felon! Catch him!

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:52.160
Mr. Dan, what are you going to do when you see Rouge?

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:54.330
I dunno! I'll basquat!

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.040
Basquat?

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:56.750
Come on, keep up!

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:59.160
Why basquash?

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.170
To get rid of this stupid muddle!

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:02.940
Is that the only reason?

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:04.950
Shit!

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:07.170
Give it up, Dunk Mask!

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:11.450
Mr. Dan, why choose basquash?

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:14.060
You never shut up.

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:15.010
It's because basquash...

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.020
Because basquash...

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.900
...doesn't lie!

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:28.990
Basquash.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:32.490
A world with no undersides and no facades.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:37.790
Where you place all of your power into the impact, and you're ricocheted back.

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:41.040
Where you play notes of the entire musical scale.

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:43.460
and you take your own crooked path.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:48.070
That in itself is a way of living.

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:52.730
The true embodiment of living with your whole heart and soul.

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:55.810
That is basquash!

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.000
Jiiya, are you awake?

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:02.310
Yes, Princess.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:06.050
It appears I've come to the end of my journey.

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:09.980
Here, a new journey will begin.

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:13.480
My journey as Flora Skybloom.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:14.590
Princess.

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:18.490
Basquash!

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:26.970
I want to see your basquash, and your legend, through to the end.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:31.880
Show respect!

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:34.000
Th-That's...

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:37.800
The royal family's... Princess Flora!

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:41.020
Crossdressing again?

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:42.670
You decided you liked it?

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:45.600
Who do you think this personage is?

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:49.270
His Majesty Regalia the Thirteenth's second daughter,

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:51.980
Her Royal Highness Flora Skybloom!

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.400
Bow your heads! Show proper respect!

00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:58.030
Princess?

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:59.510
So you're a woman?

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:03.690
What?! You were a woman? Why?!

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:05.500
I don't have time to explain.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.140
Hurry to Rouge's side.

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:09.130
Okay...

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:14.010
Your journey will not end here, Dan JD.

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:16.170
B-But Your Highness!

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:18.180
Dunk Mask is a wanted fugitive.

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:20.430
I will take responsibility.

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.190
Understood!

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:22.640
Bow your heads!

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.140
Go on, hurry.

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:28.760
Begone.

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:35.220
To save Earthdash and the Moon.

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:37.030
And for the sake of the legend.

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:41.950
One day, I'll become a true basquasher.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:45.780
On that day I'll join you again.

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:51.600
The way I feel about you...

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:54.260
What are you doing? Let's go.

00:19:55.370 --> 00:19:56.090
Pardon?

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:58.510
You're worried about Rouge, right?

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:01.430
Yes, but I am the second princess of the Skybloom-

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:02.800
So what?

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:04.810
You're a basquasher too.

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.920
I'm a basquasher too...?

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:11.940
Yes!

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:14.200
We shall go together!

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:15.440
Princess!

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:17.840
Hey, that hurts!

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:24.130
Mr. Dan, it seemed pretty easy for you to wrap your head around me being a girl.

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:26.380
Because you are!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.000
Pretty simple, aren't you?

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:29.730
Is there something wrong with that?

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:34.670
No. It's because you're like that that I lov—

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:39.600
You're the total opposite of Miyuki or Haruka, so I just didn't notice.

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:44.860
I hate you!

00:20:45.690 --> 00:20:48.230
Like I said, impossible to figure out...

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:55.100
Now lets give it our best basquasher.

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:57.280
By the way Rouge are you okay?

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.040
Next time: Clutch Shot.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:06.400
NEXT TIME

00:20:58.040 --> 00:21:06.380
CLUTCH SHOT

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:06.400
CLUTCH SHOT

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:00.140
Alright,

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:01.290
lets create a legend!

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:02.360
Hey Rouge....

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:04.020
Basquasher!!!!
